{title: Dheere Dheere Pyar Ko Badhana}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Anuradha Paudwal}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Dheere dheere pyaar [F]ko badhana hai
[C]Had se [G]guzar jana hai
[G]Mujhe bas tujhse [F]dil lagana hai
[C]Had se [G]guzar jana hai
[G]Aisi zindagi hogi, [Am]har taraf khushi hogi
[F]Itana pyar [C]doonga tujhe, [G]aye mere sanam
[C]Ab na koi gham hoga, [Am]na ye pyar kam hoga
[F]Sathi mere [C]mujhko tere sar [G]ki hai kasam
[G]Ik dooje [F]ko aazamaana hai
[C]Had se [G]guzar jana hai
[G]Mai akela kya karta, [Am]aise hi aanhe bharata
[F]Tere pyar [C]ke liye, [G]tadapata umra bhar
[G]Jaane kya mai kar jaati [Am]yun tadap ke mara jati
[F]Bin tere [C]bhala kaise, [G]katata yeh safar
[G]Tere liye mar [F]ke bhi dikhaana hai
[C]Had se [G]guzar jana hai
[G]Tera chand sa mukhada, [Am]tu jigar ka hai tukada
[F]Tu hamare [C]sapnon ki [G]jhil ka kanval
[G]Jaan se tu hai pyara, [Am]aankho ka tu hai tara
[F]Bin tere [C]jiyenge ab hum [G]na ek pal
[G]Sab kuchh tujh [F]pe hi lutaana hai
[C]Had se [G]guzar jana hai
